OL,3,GNEWSARescue teams 'stretched further
OL,4,Athan ever'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMountain rescuers have said they are
OL,7,F"stretched further than ever" and on
OL,8,Ftrack for their busiest year on record.
OL,10,FKeswick Mountain Rescue Team (KMRT)
OL,11,Fsaid August was its busiest month ever
OL,12,Fwith 30 rescues and it had been out on
OL,13,Fa total of 136 rescues so far in 2026.
OL,15,FKMRT said it "echoed" recent comments
OL,16,Fby Eryri mountain rescuers who called
OL,17,Ffor walkers to take "personal
OL,18,Fresponsibility" for their actions after
OL,19,Fit too posted its highest rescue
OL,20,Ffigures to date.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
