OL,3,GNEWSARescue teams 'stretched further
OL,4,Athan ever'
OL,5,
OL,6,FVolunteers said while they "loved
OL,7,Fseeing people out enjoying the
OL,8,Fbeautiful fells", many callouts could
OL,9,Fhave been "easily prevented with just a
OL,10,Fbit of extra planning, a reliable
OL,11,Fnavigation backup and the right gear
OL,12,Ffor changing conditions".
